          "source_id": "superhero_official",
          "source_url": "https://superherocapital.com/",
          "source_title": "Searching for the next Superheroes",
          "source_content_hash": "427cbd7747219a69063af9e12627ec52d90155863398f677efeb7d4aefd893c4",
          "quote": "Seed funding for the superheroes. In case you haven´t noticed yet, we are a VC fund. Nothing more, nothing less. So tell us who you are, why do you do this and what you look for. We initially invest up to 1M€ to help you get to the next level, and our primary focus is on software-driven startups in the New Nordics (Finland and the Baltics). We currently invest from our 2024 fund. Occasionally we might join a round outside the New Nordics too. We want you to answer 2 simple questions: \"Why us?\" \"Why now? Everything else is nice to have. Ultimately, you matter. As simple as that. And in return",
